          <p style="margin:0;max-width:480px;font:400 13.5px/1.6 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#9a9a92">As word spreads, more and more customers arrive — all at once.</p>
        </div>
        <div id="cap5" class="cap" style="position:absolute;left:0;bottom:0;opacity:0">
          <div style="font:600 11px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:12px">05 — SCALE</div>
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 9px;font:800 30px 'Archivo',sans-serif;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#F2F0EA">It scales itself.</h3>
          <p style="margin:0;max-width:480px;font:400 13.5px/1.6 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#9a9a92">Whether you're a small shop with a hundred visitors or an enterprise with half a million, the same backend grows to fit — then winds back down.</p>
