          <div style="font:600 11px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:12px">06 — DATA</div>
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 9px;font:800 30px 'Archivo',sans-serif;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#F2F0EA">And you see it all.</h3>
          <p style="margin:0;max-width:480px;font:400 13.5px/1.6 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#9a9a92">Live analytics show your traffic, revenue and what's working — so you know what to do next.</p>
